（录自黄少龙编著之《象棋破阵秘诀》一书）。","text":"\n　　【增注】黑如炮８平９，则车二平三，炮９退１，炮八平七，炮９平７，车三平四，士４进５，车九平八，车１平２，车八进六，红方先手扩大（录自黄少龙编著之《象棋破阵秘诀》一书）。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"||　　如改走象３进５，成另一种攻防阵式，有异曲同工之妙。","text":"\n　　如改走象３进５，成另一种攻防阵式，有异曲同工之妙。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment16:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment16","raw_text":"||　　冲卒换马后，黑方吃亏。可改走马６进７，则炮五平四，车１进１，成对攻之势。","text":"\n　　冲卒换马后，黑方吃亏。可改走马６进７，则炮五平四，车１进１，成对攻之势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":16,"anchor_node_id":"0:16","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"||　　要着！封住车炮，局势开始占先。","text":"\n　　要着！封住车炮，局势开始占先。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":"||　　败着。应走炮8平9兑车，虽可能少卒，但尚有谋和希望。","text":"\n　　败着。应走炮8平9兑车，虽可能少卒，但尚有谋和希望。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment27","raw_text":"||　　取胜的巧手！既要打马兼双车杀士，又伏有卸中炮打双黑车，一箭双鵰，黑方难以应付。","text":"\n　　取胜的巧手！既要打马兼双车杀士，又伏有卸中炮打双黑车，一箭双鵰，黑方难以应付。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"0:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment28","raw_text":"||　　黑方无奈，只好弃马沉炮，以求一搏。","text":"\n　　黑方无奈，只好弃马沉炮，以求一搏。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"||　　（张胜）||||　　紅方平車棄炮，再進車攻象，算準可成絕殺，弈來精妙之至！||||　　【原位卒按】以下黑如接走象３进１，则车七平八，士５进６，炮七进二，士４进５，炮七平九，红胜。","text":"\n　　（张胜）\n\n　　紅方平車棄炮，再進車攻象，算準可成絕殺，弈來精妙之至！\n\n　　【原位卒按】以下黑如接走象３进１，则车七平八，士５进６，炮七进二，士４进５，炮七平九，红胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"||　　【增注】","text":"\n　　【增注】","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment43:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment43","raw_text":"||　　红胜。","text":"\n　　红胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":43,"anchor_node_id":"0:43","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18","raw_text":"||　　可成对攻之势。","text":"\n　　可成对攻之势。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"1:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_10:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_10","raw_text":"||　　【增注】","text":"\n　　【增注】","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"2:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_19","raw_text":"||　　红方先手扩大（录自黄少龙编著之《象棋破阵秘诀》一书）。","text":"\n　　红方先手扩大（录自黄少龙编著之《象棋破阵秘诀》一书）。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"2:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["第35局：双枪将巧攻盘河马"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["象棋鬼手百局 朱剑秋"],"DhtmlXQ_date":[" 1958年11月6日弈于天津"],"DhtmlXQ_place":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":[""],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["哈尔滨张东禄"],"DhtmlXQ_redteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["北京侯玉山"],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["红胜"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["C19 中炮过河车左边马对屏风马"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["实战全局/开局"],"DhtmlXQ_timerule":[""],"DhtmlXQ_endtype":[""],"DhtmlXQ_firstnum":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_gametype":[""]},"sourc